{"id":"643423a39e2e7001988ba80c7fc85b60d571123a","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/015/119.htm","title":"联想 ThinkBook X AI 2027 轻薄商务本发售，到手价 7,999 元起","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：溯波","excerpt":"其采用精工铝材机身，配备 2880×1880 120Hz 500nits OLED 屏幕，内置 65Whr 电池，轻约 1.06kg、薄约 12.9mm。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"297a\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 10 月 20 日消息，联想 (lenovo) 轻薄商务本 ThinkBook X AI 2027 (ThinkBook X G4 IWC) 现已发售。其基于第 3 代英特尔酷睿 \"Wildcat Lake\" 处理器，本次市售型号均为星耀白配色。</p><p data-vmark=\"c0b1\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/bd7bc713-14e8-4097-a180-dd202246aeef.jpg\" w=\"750\" h=\"840\" data-vmark=\"3e3f\" title=\"联想 ThinkBook X AI 2027 轻薄商务本发售，到手价 7,999 元起\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/bd7bc713-14e8-4097-a180-dd202246aeef.jpg\" width=\"750\" height=\"840\"></p><ul><li><p data-vmark=\"054b\">酷睿 5 处理器 315 + 16GB + 1TB：到手价 7,999 元；</p></li><li><p data-vmark=\"2b69\">酷睿 7 处理器 350 + 32GB + 1TB：到手价 11,999 元。</p></li></ul><p data-vmark=\"efec\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/74465f17-567e-486d-af17-4074eb6f51c2.jpg\" w=\"800\" h=\"600\" data-vmark=\"78d2\" title=\"联想 ThinkBook X AI 2027 轻薄商务本发售，到手价 7,999 元起\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/74465f17-567e-486d-af17-4074eb6f51c2.jpg\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\"></p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/5DG8tGY\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5gGiQgn\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5OGu5rB\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5GG3ICX\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/5GGgkVz\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5rGbp7D\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5OGbr6L\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252f5GGiNyj%26EA